    "updated_at": "2016-07-04T08:30:18Z",
    "body": "You can have the value snap to integers by adding `step=\"1\"` (and a default value that is an integer).\n\n``` html\n<input type=range min=1 max=5 value=1 step=1>\n```\n\nLet me know if I misunderstood. :-)\n",
